What is Cosmetic OEM/ODM?
Cosmetic OEM (Original Equipment Manufacturer) and ODM (Original Design Manufacturer) represent essential outsourcing models in the beauty industry, allowing brands to focus on marketing while leveraging specialized manufacturing expertise. These services cover everything from product formulation and packaging to regulatory compliance, spanning skincare, haircare, makeup, and niche beauty segments.
